      "widgets_values": [
        "Grainy 35mm point-and-shoot photograph taken at night with harsh direct on-camera flash, beside a bus shelter on a rainy street in an East Asian city. Eye-level medium shot framed from mid-thigh up: a young East Asian woman in her mid-twenties with long damp black hair and bangs leans back against a white advertising board covered in black and blue graffiti tags and red Chinese characters. She holds a cigarette to her lips, a thin wisp of smoke drifting past her face, her eyes half-closed; flushed cheeks, orange eyeshadow and a black choker. She wears a black cropped knit sweater with a white sailor-style collar edged in black trim and a small embroidered white flower, and a grey plaid pleated mini skirt. Behind her a white city bus with brightly lit windows waits at the curb, the wet asphalt reflects orange street lamps, and the night air is misty. Heavy film grain, flash-bright skin against deep night shadows, Y2K film snapshot look, tasteful street-fashion photo.",
